{"slug":"ohdsi-achilles","name":"OHDSI/Achilles","what_it_is":"An R package that generates ~200 descriptive statistics analyses over an OMOP CDM v5.x database, producing pre-computed results for ARES, Atlas, and other OHDSI tools.","components":["achilles() core function","createIndices()","getAnalysisDetails()","dropAllScratchTables()","DatabaseConnector (JDBC)","SqlRender (dialect translation)","ParallelLogger","ARES JSON export"],"protocols":["OMOP CDM v5.3/v5.4","HADES package conventions","JDBC via DatabaseConnector"],"measurement":["~200 analysis IDs across person, visit, condition, drug, measurement, procedure, observation, death, cost","smallCellCount suppression (default 5)","Temporal trend analyses","Cost analyses (optional)"],"modes":["Single-threaded (temp tables)","Multi-threaded (permanent staging)","SQL-only (no execution)","Selective analysis (include/exclude IDs)"],"constraints":["R >= 4.0.0 and Java required","OMOP CDM v5.3/v5.4 only","createIndices unsupported on Redshift/Netezza","Multi-threaded needs writable scratch schema","Oracle needs tempEmulationSchema","smallCellCount=0 may expose re-identifiable data"],"docker_services":[],"notable_absences":["No Docker","No DQ rule engine (separate package)","No REST API","AchillesWeb deprecated; ARES is successor"],"configuration":[],"fault_injection":[]}